&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build the Future with Us —&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;EquipmentShare is Hiring a Corporate Development Counsel&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At EquipmentShare, we’re not just filling a role — &lt;strong&gt;we’re assembling the best team on the planet to build something that’s never been built before&lt;/strong&gt;. We’re on a mission to transform an industry that’s been stuck in the past by empowering contractors and communities through innovative technology, real-time support, and a team that truly cares.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;We’re hiring a &lt;strong&gt;Corporate Development Counsel&lt;/strong&gt; to support our Corporate HQ in &lt;strong&gt;Columbia, MO&lt;/strong&gt; and we’re looking for someone who’s ready to grow with us, bring energy and drive to their work, and help us build the future of construction. You will be responsible for managing the legal aspects of our M&amp;amp;A and strategic investment activities from start to finish—from initial structuring and due diligence to negotiation, closing, and integration. This is a highly visible position that requires close collaboration with senior leadership, business teams, and stakeholders across the company. The ideal candidate is a &quot;deal-person&quot; at heart who balances expert legal advice with a pragmatic, business-oriented mindset.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Primary Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structure, draft, and negotiate key transaction documents for acquisitions, divestitures, and strategic investments (e.g., term sheets, LOIs, merger agreements, asset purchase agreements, stock purchase agreements, and investment/shareholder agreements).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and manage the end-to-end legal due diligence process. This includes coordinating internal specialists (e.g., IP, privacy, employment, tax), managing virtual data rooms, identifying and quantifying key risks, and summarizing findings for business stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the primary legal advisor to the Corporate Development team and other business leaders. Provide strategic and tactical advice on deal structures, risk-shifting, and negotiation strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with stakeholders across the organization (Finance, Tax, HR, Operations, and Product) to ensure all functional aspects of a transaction are addressed and that the deal aligns with business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and oversee outside counsel on M&amp;amp;A and investment transactions, ensuring high-quality work, cost-effectiveness, and alignment with our company&#39;s goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support post-closing integration efforts to ensure a smooth transition and the realization of deal value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help develop and refine our M&amp;amp;A &quot;playbook,&quot; including templates, checklists, and internal processes to drive efficiency and consistency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why EquipmentShare?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Because we do things differently — and we think you’ll feel it from day one. We’re a people-first company powered by cutting-edge technology. That means our proprietary T3 platform doesn’t just run our business — it also makes your job easier, safer, and more connected. Whether you’re behind the wheel, under the hood, leading a branch, or closing deals — tech supports &lt;em&gt;you&lt;/em&gt;, and you drive &lt;em&gt;us&lt;/em&gt; forward.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a team of problem-solvers, go-getters, and builders. And we’re looking for teammates who take pride in doing meaningful work and want to be part of &lt;strong&gt;building something special&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Perks &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full medical, dental, and vision coverage for full-time employees&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous PTO + paid holidays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401(k) + company match&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gym membership stipend + wellness programs (earn PTO and prizes!)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company events and food truck nights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;16 hours of paid volunteer time per year — give back to the community you call home&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Career advancement, leadership training, and professional development opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You want to be part of a team that’s not just changing an industry for the sake of change — we’re transforming it to make it safer, more secure, and more productive. You bring grit, heart, and humility to your work, and you’re excited about the opportunity to grow within a fast-paced, mission-driven environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for people who:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;See challenges as opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embrace change and continuous improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring energy, effort, and optimism every day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Qualifications&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to understand business objectives and to apply legal principles in a pragmatic, risk-based manner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in all facets of the M&amp;amp;A lifecycle and a strong understanding of corporate law, contract law, and securities law.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to communicate complex legal issues clearly and concisely to non-legal stakeholders, both verbally and in writing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to manage multiple complex projects simultaneously, navigating tight deadlines and high-pressure situations with poise and organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated initiative and a proactive, solution-oriented mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills, with the ability to explain legal concepts clearly to business stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven sound judgment, commercial awareness, and ability to balance risk with business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organized, detail-oriented, and able to manage multiple priorities with urgency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adaptable, self-motivated, and comfortable working independently in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with contract lifecycle management tools or legal technology is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Juris Doctor (J.D.) from an accredited law school with an active in at least one state bar membership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 4 years of relevant legal experience, with a significant focus on M&amp;amp;A. This must include direct, hands-on experience in drafting and negotiating complex transaction agreements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience at a law firm in its M&amp;amp;A/Corporate practice is strongly preferred. In-house experience at a technology or high-growth company is a significant plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Physical Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to sit for long periods and work on a compute&lt;strong&gt;r.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Workplace For All&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At EquipmentShare, we believe the best solutions come from a team that reflects the world around us. Our initiative — &lt;em&gt;A Workplace For All&lt;/em&gt; — is rooted in the belief that we must work together to solve some of the toughest problems in construction. That means attracting, developing, and retaining great people from all walks of life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We value different backgrounds, talents, and perspectives. We want you to feel like you belong here — because you do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EquipmentShare is an EOE M/F/D/V.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Employment is contingent on passing a background check. Additionally, some roles require passing a drug test, depending on the job responsibilities.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

