&lt;li data-start=&quot;604&quot; data-end=&quot;677&quot;&gt;Part-time or Full-time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;678&quot; data-end=&quot;710&quot;&gt;Paid trach and vent training for qualified nurses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;711&quot; data-end=&quot;774&quot;&gt;Ongoing clinical support—you’ll never feel alone on the job&lt;/li&gt;
