&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Baptist Home Health Care by BAYADA&lt;/strong&gt; is looking for compassionate and dedicated &lt;strong&gt;Part Time CNA, Certified Nursing Assistant or HHA &lt;/strong&gt;to join our team in Jacksonville, FL. This office services our adult and geriatric clients on a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;per visit basis&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;in territories throughout&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Western Duval County, FL.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;Must be a licensed FL CNA or have a HHA certificate!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
